Kenna Park paved-path walk","title":"Take a loop on McKenna’s paved paths","subtitle":"McKenna Park, University Park neighborhood","notes":"Use the paved paths for an easy walking-and-talking loop, then leave space around active games and playground users; plan around the City’s posted park hours.","short_summary":"A simple no-equipment walking loop close to campus.","evidence_claim":"McKenna Park’s City listing includes paved paths and gives park hours of 5 a.m.–midnight.","source_url":"https://www.portland.gov/parks/mckenna-park","source_title":"McKenna Park | Portland Parks & Recreation","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"No equipment or reservation is needed for walking; observe any temporary closures and leash rules.","cost_status":"free","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"university-park-open-lawn-paths","subject_type":"activity","entity_name":"University Park open-lawn walk","title":"Walk the open lawn and paths at University Park","subtitle":"University Park, Portsmouth","notes":"Meet at the park entrance on N Foss Avenue and make a relaxed lap on the paved paths; the open lawn gives a straightforward place to sit and talk.","short_summary":"A nearby 11-acre municipal park with paths and open lawn.","evidence_claim":"Portland Parks describes University Park as having mature trees, open lawn areas, a playground, and park paths; its posted hours are 5 a.m.–midnight.","source_url":"https://www.portland.gov/parks/construction/north-portland-parks-improvement-projects","source_title":"North Portland Parks Improvement Projects | Portland Parks & Recreation","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Use the park during posted hours and avoid organized-field activity. No purchase or admission is listed for walking the public park.","cost_stat